{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted","id":1535883,"title":"Any Apocryphal Keyword charms published after Miracles of the Solar Exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-18T20:24:56-07:00","id":1535883,"title":"Any Apocryphal Keyword charms published after Miracles of the Solar Exalted?","content":"Have been focused on other games for some time but got back to tinkering with Exalted recently and while at it got curious if there were other &quot;unusual backer requests&quot; published in the splats or any other books that came out after Miracles of the Solar Exalted.<br /> <br /> Part curious if that went beyond a one-time thing, part desire to collect them all to make a narrative and some NPCs out of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T15:52:46-07:00","id":1535927,"title":"","content":"Those &quot;Add a Charm&quot; tiers on the crowdfunding campaigns are where they come from...but only if you insist on not listening to feedback from Onyx Path. So they are very few in number indeed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T17:47:42-07:00","id":1535941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1535927#post1535927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those &quot;Add a Charm&quot; tiers on the crowdfunding campaigns are where they come from...but only if you insist on not listening to feedback from Onyx Path. So they are very few in number indeed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that was my impression overall - my precise doubt is if there have been any outside that one batch in Miracles at all and if so where to find them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T11:08:51-07:00","id":1536000,"title":"","content":"As I recall, Vance and Minton kind of disavowed the whole concept of the Apocryphal Keyword.<br /> <br /> I'm not going to try and unpack that beyond a general sense that they feel that if an Exalted Charm gets published, it can be regarded as suitable across the board.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T20:32:55-07:00","id":1536032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1536000#post1536000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I recall, Vance and Minton kind of disavowed the whole concept of the Apocryphal Keyword.<br /> <br /> I'm not going to try and unpack that beyond a general sense that they feel that if an Exalted Charm gets published, it can be regarded as suitable across the board.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, i can understand why the whole thing could be thorny and probably stopped right after Miracles came out. Having a charm published but declared &quot;not suitable to all tables&quot; is something that not all backers might take the same way or be fine with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-21T11:41:04-07:00","id":1536071,"title":"","content":"Actually, I seem to have misremembered slightly. It seems to have been phrased more as a commitment to trying their utmost to work with a Backer to figure out how to bring the Charm concept to life in a way that makes Apocryphal unnecessary.<br /> <br /> If a person who paid for a Charm is <i>really</i> committed to something that is really out of step with the setting or general Exalted type, they're getting their money's worth, but it does seem like it will end up being called Apocryphal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-05T12:44:03-08:00","id":1548988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1536071#post1536071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, I seem to have misremembered slightly. It seems to have been phrased more as a commitment to trying their utmost to work with a Backer to figure out how to bring the Charm concept to life in a way that makes Apocryphal unnecessary.<br /> <br /> If a person who paid for a Charm is <i>really</i> committed to something that is really out of step with the setting or general Exalted type, they're getting their money's worth, but it does seem like it will end up being called Apocryphal.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is good to have clarified indeed.<br /> <br /> But back on beating a mostly dead horse.... were the any charms classified as Apocryphal in later books? I'm guessing none or very few indeed, but still curious about the precise answer either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-06T04:52:05-08:00","id":1549008,"title":"","content":"There are no Apocryphal charms outside of Miracles. I think the main factors in its existence were.<ul><li>Legacy of 2e Design \u2013 In Exalted 2e, if an Exact had a capability, it was typically expressed as a native Charm rather than something separate.</li> <li>Solar Charm Philosophy \u2013 Solar Charms are defined by pushing skill to superhuman levels but stop short of outright breaking reality and opinions vary wildly on when they've reached that point.</li> <li>Backer Influence &amp; Developer Issues \u2013 Some special backers were disillusioned during the long development cycle and didn't want to collaborate with the original dev team, who to be 100% fair weren\u2019t known for their diplomacy.\u200b</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T19:18:32-08:00","id":1549097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549008#post1549008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]Solar Charm Philosophy \u2013 Solar Charms are defined by pushing skill to superhuman levels but stop short of outright breaking reality and opinions vary wildly on when they've reached that point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, I think breaking reality could be a valid way to describe the process or outcome of certain Solar Charms. It just requires a particular aesthetic or thematic constraint.<br /> <br /> It's like, do you call the Solar Performance Charm to do things like affect environmental conditions superhuman musical instrument skill or bending reality? But it's evocative of the feats of Orpheus, who in his overall vibe could reasonably be considered to strongly resonate within the range of the Solar archetypes.<br /> <br /> I'm actually trying to remember which Charms were Apocryphal besides the one to do a fusion dance with one's Lunar mate. There was something under Sail?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T23:15:14-08:00","id":1549100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549097#post1549097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know, I think breaking reality could be a valid way to describe the process or outcome of certain Solar Charms. It just requires a particular aesthetic or thematic constraint.<br /> <br /> It's like, do you call the Solar Performance Charm to do things like affect environmental conditions superhuman musical instrument skill or bending reality? But it's evocative of the feats of Orpheus, who in his overall vibe could reasonably be considered to strongly resonate within the range of the Solar archetypes.<br /> <br /> I'm actually trying to remember which Charms were Apocryphal besides the one to do a fusion dance with one's Lunar mate. There was something under Sail?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Several in Sail actually. There's one that allows you to jury rig a mast out of anything and everything lying around at the moment,(the backer wanted to have a power to replicate a joke of their group's) the one that replicates he Picard Maneuver from TNG, and the one you were thinking of where you introduce a major hazard to barely evade to escape foes.<br /> <br /> There's a resistance one that functions similarly to Diamond Body Prana, that I don't really understand the logic of even when reading the explanation, Outside of the fusion one I didn't see any others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-09T10:30:39-07:00","id":1549107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549100#post1549100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a resistance one that functions similarly to Diamond Body Prana, that I don't really understand the logic of even when reading the explanation</div> </div> </div> </div>I see two Resistance Charms in Miracles, Armed and Ready Discipline and Fortress-Body Discipline, and neither has the Apocryphal Keyword.<br /> <br /> Is this another of those instances where I wound up with an older edition of a book or something that hadn't been given some minor corrections? <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-09T11:14:18-07:00","id":1549108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549107#post1549107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I see two Resistance Charms in Miracles, Armed and Ready Discipline and Fortress-Body Discipline, and neither has the Apocryphal Keyword.<br /> <br /> Is this another of those instances where I wound up with an older edition of a book or something that hadn't been given some minor corrections?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Blade Turning Body Technique, its right before Fortress-body in my copy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-11T05:41:08-07:00","id":1549152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549108#post1549108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Blade Turning Body Technique, its right before Fortress-body in my copy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure what to make of this sort of thing happening. Certainly, I'm not going to download a new copy of the book for the sake of one Charm.<br /> <br /> Looking at a summary of it on a tree compilation, am I right in guessing that it was made Apocryphal because of some effect of being casually immune to certain levels of damage for an extended period?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-11T10:00:21-07:00","id":1549155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549097#post1549097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know, I think breaking reality could be a valid way to describe the process or outcome of certain Solar Charms. It just requires a particular aesthetic or thematic constraint.<br /> <br /> It's like, do you call the Solar Performance Charm to do things like affect environmental conditions superhuman musical instrument skill or bending reality? But it's evocative of the feats of Orpheus, who in his overall vibe could reasonably be considered to strongly resonate within the range of the Solar archetypes.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s exactly my point. Any reasonable limit placed on Solar Charms\u2014aside from obvious strawman examples, like growing tentacles\u2014is bound to have players trying to push the boundaries. And honestly? that\u2019s fine at individual tables\u2014go wild! But when it comes to the content of an official suppliment like Miracles? That\u2019s where Apocryphal might be necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-19T16:28:31-07:00","id":1549452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549152#post1549152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure what to make of this sort of thing happening. Certainly, I'm not going to download a new copy of the book for the sake of one Charm.<br /> <br /> Looking at a summary of it on a tree compilation, am I right in guessing that it was made Apocryphal because of some effect of being casually immune to certain levels of damage for an extended period?</div> </div> </div> </div>Aporcyphal because it apparently &quot;uses the design logic of solar armor crafting charms.&quot; Based on the wording the backer wanted something like Diamond-Body but Diamond-Body is was too variable for them. *shrugs* I don't look too deeply into Solar resistance to be able to compare it to Diamond-body accurately. <br /> <br /> Ignores incidental injuries like getting cut from broken glass on the ground and going through windows, burning or lacerating types of environmental damage are negated if they're not doing at least 4L. Gives a bunch of soak and some extra hardness, not compatible with armor of diamond body. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-20T06:29:07-07:00","id":1549457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549452#post1549452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Aporcyphal because it apparently &quot;uses the design logic of solar armor crafting charms.&quot; Based on the wording the backer wanted something like Diamond-Body but Diamond-Body is was too variable for them. *shrugs* I don't look too deeply into Solar resistance to be able to compare it to Diamond-body accurately.<br /> <br /> Ignores incidental injuries like getting cut from broken glass on the ground and going through windows, burning or lacerating types of environmental damage are negated if they're not doing at least 4L. Gives a bunch of soak and some extra hardness, not compatible with armor of diamond body.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... Diamond-Body is based on providing a persistent enhancement to soak based on the results of a dice roll (although with at least three automatic successes). I'm gathering from this that there was a specific design intent to reconcile Charms to grant Solars superhuman durability with the significance of armour (including armour that can be created instantly with a Charm) by making the unarmoured Charms either quick bursts or something like Diamond-Body where it takes a bit of a gamble.<br /> <br /> Whereas it sounds like the backer wanted a persistent durability enhancement for an unarmoured character that would be set.<br /> <br /> Can I ask what the numbers are on Blade Turning Body Technique?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-20T13:46:39-07:00","id":1549463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549457#post1549457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm... Diamond-Body is based on providing a persistent enhancement to soak based on the results of a dice roll (although with at least three automatic successes). I'm gathering from this that there was a specific design intent to reconcile Charms to grant Solars superhuman durability with the significance of armour (including armour that can be created instantly with a Charm) by making the unarmoured Charms either quick bursts or something like Diamond-Body where it takes a bit of a gamble.<br /> <br /> Whereas it sounds like the backer wanted a persistent durability enhancement for an unarmoured character that would be set.<br /> <br /> Can I ask what the numbers are on Blade Turning Body Technique?</div> </div> </div> </div>8 soak, specifically stated to be vs withering attacks, an additional 5 hardness plus the environmental protections I already mentioned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-21T03:42:33-07:00","id":1549476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549463#post1549463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 8 soak, specifically stated to be vs withering attacks, an additional 5 hardness</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Soak is always just against withering attacks unless stated otherwise, isn't it? I suppose it would be worded like that just for the sake of being a Duel Charm.<br /> <br /> It sounds to me like it's not strictly superior to Diamond Body, but since it's the equivalent of rolling something like five successes and having maximum Stamina for that Charm, it's close enough to it. Even if something like the mote cost and minimums are higher, it still sounds like it comes out as Apocryphal largely by virtue of turning an already published Charm into a speed bump. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-21T12:56:24-07:00","id":1549489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1535883-any-apocryphal-keyword-charms-published-after-miracles-of-the-solar-exalted?p=1549476#post1549476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, Soak is 